el's playing, this boring trip finally got a lot more interesting!",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_264"],["ctl","avg3_138","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,"huanxin","Linear",0.5],["say","Peer Trekker","Tell me about it! Miss Caramel, do you have any plans to perform at Emor's Grand Theater?",0,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.6],["w",0.6],["show","avg1_147","a","017",null,-0.1,1.15,0,null,null],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,null,20.0,1.15,"Linear",20.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.5],["se","se_070"],["ctl","avg1_147","a",null,null,null,0.0,1.0,null,"2TiaoYue","Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_147","a","009","flurry",null,null,null,null,"jinzhang","Linear",1.0],["w",1.0],["say","avg1_147","The Grand Theater? No way! A venue that big—I'm just a street performer, I wouldn't even dare think about it!",0,""],["w",0.5],["se","se_061"],["chd",0,2,"avg3_138","a","002",null],["chd",0,0,"avg3_139","a","002",null],["ctl","avg3_138","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","Peer Trekker","You absolutely could! When the time comes, you have to let us know. We'll definitely show up to support you!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_139","a",null,"star",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","Travelling Trekker","Your music is awesome, you are awesome. If you just put your mind to it, you'll get there in no time!",0,""],["ctl","avg1_147","a","005",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_138","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","Peer Trekker","Yeah! We'll be rooting for you all the way! We're already your fans!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_147","a","006","music",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_147","Hehe, thank you everyone ♪ I'll do my best!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_147","a","005","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_147","I'm taking the right at the fork up ahead. You two, maybe we'll meet again!